@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8081

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Invoke
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoke
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt":"Responde hola", "model":"auto", "yolo":false}

### Job
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt":"Crea hello.py con un saludo"}

### Verify and retry
POST {{baseUrl}}/run
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt":"Crea hello.py con un saludo", "check":"python3 hello.py", "max_attempts":3}

### List jobs (use an ID from this response for get/cancel/stream)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs

### Schedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{"cron":"0 9 * * 1-5", "prompt":"Revisa el proyecto", "name":"Revisión diaria", "model":"auto"}
